        }
        RULES {
            #L5RPW61xA4fT2iA6pJ2hC4zF7lX: ghostlands_warrior_title_ability "Eyes of the Yodhaniya (Title Ability): When you make a check to see through supernatural illusion, reduce the TN of the check by 1. If you are in Defiled terrain, reduce the TN by 2 instead."
